{"id":"5d451f45281e1b22","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-turing-join.md","title":"Recursive Join of Sets","display":"df-turing-join — Recursive Join of Sets","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-turing-join","aliases":["62-df-turing-join"],"display":"df-turing-join — Recursive Join of Sets","depends_on":["[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Remark I.3.4; Theorem II.1.7","source_pages":[8,64],"source_pdf_pages":[26,82]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-turing-join"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-turing-join</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-join — Recursive Join of Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Remark I.3.4; Theorem II.1.7"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>8</span><span>64</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>26</span><span>82</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\">\\(A,B,C\\)</span> 为数的集合；语言见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>。Join 在对象语言中是三元谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span> 是存在时的唯一集缩写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}join}\\vdash\\;\\mathsf{Join}(A,B,C)\\leftrightarrow\\forall k\\;[k\\in C\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\le k((k=2n\\land n\\in A)\\lor(k=2n+1\\land n\\in B))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}join}\\vdash\\;\\mathsf{Join}(A,B,C)\\leftrightarrow\\forall k\\;[k\\in C\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\le k((k=2n\\land n\\in A)\\lor(k=2n+1\\land n\\in B))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\oplus B\\coloneqq\\{2n:n\\in A\\}\\cup\\{2n+1:n\\in B\\}\\qquad(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\oplus B\\coloneqq\\{2n:n\\in A\\}\\cup\\{2n+1:n\\in B\\}\\qquad(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>加入和投影都是有效的数码操作；RCA₀ 中由有界理解得到 C，外延唯一性立即成立。模型族的有限 join 闭包与 Turing 度上的上确界相对应。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Remark I.3.4; Theorem II.1.7；纸面页 8, 64；PDF 页 26, 82。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B,C$ 为数的集合；语言见 [[62-df-L2]]。Join 在对象语言中是三元谓词，$\\oplus$ 是存在时的唯一集缩写。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,C","display":false},{"tex":"\\oplus","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}join}\\vdash\\;\\mathsf{Join}(A,B,C)\\leftrightarrow\\forall k\\;[k\\in C\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\le k((k=2n\\land n\\in A)\\lor(k=2n+1\\land n\\in B))].","display":true},{"tex":"A\\oplus B\\coloneqq\\{2n:n\\in A\\}\\cup\\{2n+1:n\\in B\\}\\qquad(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N).","display":true}],"bytes":1164,"backlinks":[{"id":"0efbe3f2d5d172f3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$ 是元层集合族；$\\oplus$ 见 [[62-df-turing-join]]，$\\le_T$ 见 [[62-df-oracle-computation]]。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-turing-join|Recursive Join of Sets]]"},{"id":"f1525607abf065f1","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-ACA0]]；Jump 见 [[62-df-jump-operator]]；算术停机编号见 [[62-df-oracle-computation]]；参数 join 见 [[62-df-turing-join]]；$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。"}],"outgoing":["4c6d2d9f1999915f"]}